    description: "Framework YAML concept names that no detector arm reads produce nothing and no error.\n\nCOBOL's program_entrypoint and micronaut's scheduled are concept names no entry detector reads, so the rows produce no entry and no warning: the concept vocabulary has no registry. Repro: ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/fast_smart_test_build_11172026/audit/yaml_inventory.py lists concept names per YAML against the detector arms. Fix direction: a concept-name registry with a load-time check (unknown concept = error), then decide each orphan (wire or delete). Found by the entry-point-kinds concept audit (docs/audits/0027), 2026-11-20."  # 3012
